 {
  "datei": "VO2max/lactate-tolerance-2.zwo",
  "kat": "VO2max",
  "xml": "<workout_file><author>mywhooshinfo.com</author><name>Lactate Tolerance #2</name><description>Riding at threshold power for sustained periods will require a significant lactate production. To reach this lactate level in a shorter workout requires brief periods of work above threshold, with minimal recovery. \n\nWith each interval, the lactate levels will rise.</description><sportType>bike</sportType><workout>\n<Warmup  Duration=\"600\" PowerLow=\"0.44449999928474\" PowerHigh=\"0.75449997186661\"></Warmup>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"60\" Power=\"0.55000001192093\"></SteadyState>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"60\" Power=\"1.1100000143051\"></SteadyState>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"60\" Power=\"0.55000001192093\"></SteadyState>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"180\" Power=\"0.85000002384186\"></SteadyState>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"120\" Power=\"0.55000001192093\"></SteadyState>\n<IntervalsT   Repeat=\"3\" OnDuration=\"120\" OnPower=\"1.210000038147\" OffDuration=\"120\" OffPower=\"0.5\">\n</IntervalsT>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"900\" Power=\"0.69999998807907\"></SteadyState>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"120\" Power=\"0.55000001192093\"></SteadyState>\n<IntervalsT   Repeat=\"3\" OnDuration=\"120\" OnPower=\"1.210000038147\" OffDuration=\"120\" OffPower=\"0.5\">\n</IntervalsT>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"180\" Power=\"0.5\"></SteadyState>\n</workout></workout_file>"
 },
 {
  "datei": "VO2max/neuromuscular-with-ac-3.zwo",
  "kat": "VO2max",
  "xml": "<workout_file><author>mywhooshinfo.com</author><name>Neuromuscular with AC #3</name><description>A challenging session that requires completing race-like intervals, involving efforts of Anaerobic Capacity, Sweetspot and neuromuscular power. \n\n5 x 5-minute 15-second intervals will see you put through a range of top-end power.</description><sportType>bike</sportType><workout>\n<Warmup  Duration=\"300\" PowerLow=\"0.44999998807907\" PowerHigh=\"0.75\"><textevent timeoffset=\"30\" message=\"A long warm up today before the main intervals.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"50\" message=\"This is a challenging session today. But definitely achievable.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"260\" message=\"First we have some low-level 1min efforts to help prepare for the main set.\"/></Warmup>\n<IntervalsT   Repeat=\"2\" OnDuration=\"60\" OnPower=\"0.80000001192093\" OffDuration=\"60\" OffPower=\"0.5\">\n</IntervalsT>\n<IntervalsT   Repeat=\"2\" OnDuration=\"60\" OnPower=\"0.98000001907349\" OffDuration=\"60\" OffPower=\"0.5\">\n</IntervalsT>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"120\" Power=\"0.5\"></SteadyState>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"120\" Power=\"0.5\"><textevent timeoffset=\"30\" message=\"Ahead we have intervals of 5min 15sec.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"40\" message=\"Opening with a 2min Anaerobic Capacity effort, we then step up through a 3min sweet spot effort...\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"50\" message=\"before finishing with a high power 15sec effort.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"100\" message=\"These efforts take good focus. Aim to hold a consistent rpm through each effort.\"/></SteadyState>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"120\" Power=\"1.2000000476837\"><textevent timeoffset=\"45\" message=\"Good start... maintain your cadence.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"110\" message=\"Now we drop down to a sweet spot effort.\"/></SteadyState>\n<Warmup  Duration=\"180\" PowerLow=\"0.87999999523163\" PowerHigh=\"0.93999999761581\"><textevent timeoffset=\"20\" message=\"A little recovery here. But keep the cadence up.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"90\" message=\"Great work. Focus on controlled breathing.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"170\" message=\"Now finish it off with a big sprint!\"/></Warmup>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"15\" Power=\"1.5\"></SteadyState>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"180\" Power=\"0.5\"><textevent timeoffset=\"20\" message=\"Perfect!... How was it?\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"40\" message=\"Just 4 more to go.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"170\" message=\"Here we go... onto the next effort.\"/></SteadyState>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"120\" Power=\"1.2000000476837\"><textevent timeoffset=\"45\" message=\"Good start... maintain your cadence.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"110\" message=\"Now we drop down to a sweet spot effort.\"/></SteadyState>\n<Warmup  Duration=\"180\" PowerLow=\"0.87999999523163\" PowerHigh=\"0.93999999761581\"><textevent timeoffset=\"20\" message=\"A little recovery here. But keep the cadence up.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"90\" message=\"Great work. Focus on controlled breathing.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"170\" message=\"Now finish it off with a big sprint!\"/></Warmup>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"15\" Power=\"1.5\"></SteadyState>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"180\" Power=\"0.5\"><textevent timeoffset=\"20\" message=\"Perfect!... How was it? Getting harder?\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"40\" message=\"Just 3 more to go.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"170\" message=\"Here we go... onto the next effort.\"/></SteadyState>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"120\" Power=\"1.2000000476837\"><textevent timeoffset=\"45\" message=\"Good start... maintain your cadence. Is it the same as previous efforts?\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"110\" message=\"Now we drop down to a sweet spot effort.\"/></SteadyState>\n<Warmup  Duration=\"180\" PowerLow=\"0.87999999523163\" PowerHigh=\"0.93999999761581\"><textevent timeoffset=\"20\" message=\"A little recovery here. But keep the cadence up.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"90\" message=\"Great work. Focus on controlled breathing.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"170\" message=\"Now finish it off with a big sprint! Same peak power as earlier.\"/></Warmup>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"15\" Power=\"1.5\"></SteadyState>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"180\" Power=\"0.5\"><textevent timeoffset=\"20\" message=\"Perfect!... How was it? Getting harder?\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"40\" message=\"Just 2 more to go.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"170\" message=\"Here we go... onto the next effort.\"/></SteadyState>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"120\" Power=\"1.2000000476837\"><textevent timeoffset=\"45\" message=\"Good start... maintain your cadence. Is it the same as previous efforts?\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"110\" message=\"Now we drop down to a sweet spot effort.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"90\" message=\"Is your HR increasing from the previous efforts?\"/></SteadyState>\n<Warmup  Duration=\"180\" PowerLow=\"0.87999999523163\" PowerHigh=\"0.93999999761581\"><textevent timeoffset=\"20\" message=\"A little recovery here. But keep the cadence up.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"90\" message=\"Great work. Focus on controlled breathing.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"170\" message=\"Now finish it off with a big sprint! Same peak power as earlier.\"/></Warmup>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"15\" Power=\"1.5\"></SteadyState>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"180\" Power=\"0.5\"><textevent timeoffset=\"20\" message=\"Perfect!... How was it? Getting harder?\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"40\" message=\"Just 1 more to go.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"170\" message=\"Here we go... last effort.\"/></SteadyState>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"120\" Power=\"1.2000000476837\"><textevent timeoffset=\"45\" message=\"Good start... maintain your cadence. Is it the same as previous efforts?\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"110\" message=\"Now we drop down to a sweet spot effort.\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"90\" message=\"Observe your HR after this step. Is it higher than the 1st set?\"/></SteadyState>\n<Warmup  Duration=\"180\" PowerLow=\"0.87999999523163\" PowerHigh=\"0.93999999761581\"><textevent timeoffset=\"20\" message=\"Are pedaling with the same fluency as the 1st set?\"/><textevent timeoffset=\"170\" message=\"Now finish it off with a big sprint! Same peak power as earlier.\"/></Warmup>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"15\" Power=\"1.5\"></SteadyState>\n<SteadyState  Duration=\"120\" Power=\"0.5\"><textevent timeoffset=\"30\" message=\"Well done! That was a big session today.\"/></SteadyState>\n<Cooldown  Duration=\"300\" PowerLow=\"0.75\" PowerHigh=\"0.44999998807907\"><textevent timeoffset=\"20\" message=\"We need a good cool down after a session like this.\"/></Cooldown>\n</workout></workout_file>"
 }
